{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the Line. Command the Fight. Survive the Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient horrors have risen from the depths, threatening to destroy what\u2019s left of civilization. As a mercenary commander, your mission is simple: <strong>defend the arenas</strong> and stop the monstrous hordes \u2014 or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, you\u2019ll place your squad. Once combat begins, there\u2019s no turning back. <strong>No mid-fight commands. No second chances.</strong><br>Success depends entirely on <strong>how well you plan and position your units.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies come in many forms: melee brutes, ranged attackers, explosive beasts, healers, and even summoners that spawn new threats mid-battle.<br>Every encounter is a test of wits, not reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical placement-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies with varied behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No active control during battle \u2014 planning is everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish visuals and intense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of arenas, each like a deadly puzzle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outthink the darkness \u2014 or will your strategy fall apart?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688250?t=1767089536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688250?t=1767089536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688250/637d260822b5d873a2c9465feb3db8146672a44b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767089536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688250/637d260822b5d873a2c9465feb3db8146672a44b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767089536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hold the Line. Command the Fight. Survive the Chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ancient horrors have risen from the depths, threatening to destroy what\u2019s left of civilization. As a mercenary commander, your mission is simple: <strong>defend the arenas</strong> and stop the monstrous hordes \u2014 or die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, you\u2019ll place your squad. Once combat begins, there\u2019s no turning back. <strong>No mid-fight commands. No second chances.</strong><br>Success depends entirely on <strong>how well you plan and position your units.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies come in many forms: melee brutes, ranged attackers, explosive beasts, healers, and even summoners that spawn new threats mid-battle.<br>Every encounter is a test of wits, not reflexes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical placement-based combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies with varied behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No active control during battle \u2014 planning is everything</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish visuals and intense atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of arenas, each like a deadly puzzle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you outthink the darkness \u2014 or will your strategy fall apart?</p>","developers":["ZERO5GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688250/3d00e888d518fd47fc52a360314d4f